{"seq":17,"trial_id":"matrix-mu-2026-11/qm-pi-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sc-02-north-team-two-asks/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T07:43:02.787Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:02:00-05:00","args_digest":"e76f7f3097169df37b67d9f5f6ad8cf56acd6f7b0bcad64cbba708eae390f405","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#north-team","text":"Marcus Lindqvist: the contact is Thea Ramaswell, Director of Yard Operations at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She's QFL's main contact on the North cheat sheet, and she's the one who flagged the duplicate arrivals on door 6 (morning shift). Dana mentioned that here on Aug 20, 2025. Just don't mix it up with Thea's ticket #4419. That one is about the barcode scanners at Door 14, not door 6."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791986520.000129"}}
